<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill names UK stocks for 1997.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill names UK stocks for 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategists at Merrill Lynch named nine UK stocks they expect to outperform through 1997, market sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The nine were Barclays Plc, British Aerospace Plc, British Airways Plc, British Land Plc, Burton Group Plc, FKI Plc, General Electric Co Plc, Ladbroke Group Plc and National Power Plc.</p>
<p>The list was presented as part of a global portfolio of stocks Merrill expects to outperform next year.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
